## =====================================================
## 本文件包含国际常用DNS服务器和一些自定义域名的直连规则
## 所有IP规则均使用no-resolve以提高性能
## =====================================================
## 国外DNS
## Google DNS
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dns.google
IP-CIDR,8.8.8.8/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,8.8.4.4/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:4860:4860::8888/128,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:4860:4860::8844/128,no-resolve

## Cloudflare DNS
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,one.one.one.one
## Standard
IP-CIDR,1.1.1.1/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.0.0.1/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1111/128,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1001/128,no-resolve
## FamilyShield
IP-CIDR,1.1.1.2/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.0.0.2/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1112/128,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1002/128,no-resolve
## Malware and adult content blocking
IP-CIDR,1.1.1.3/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.0.0.3/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1113/128,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1003/128,no-resolve

